<title>BULGARIA: Italian bank may buy stake in Bulgaria Expressbank.</title>
<headline>Italian bank may buy stake in Bulgaria Expressbank.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bulgarian National Bank (BNB) approved on Thursday the sale of a stake in Expressbank to Italy's Banca Agricola Mantovana, the BNB said in a statement.</p>
<p>&quot;BNB board decided...to issue a permit to Banca Agricola Mantovana to buy voting shares from the capital of Expressbank,&quot; said the BNB. It gave no further details.</p>
<p>State-owned Expressbank, based in the Black Sea port of Varna, posted 305 million levs pretax profit for 1995.</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, 359-2-84561</p>
</text>
